system","missing_source_classes":["电子数据采集系统说明","数据管理计划"],"target":"10.1 病例报告表"}],"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":["病例报告表设计文件","数据管理计划","电子数据采集系统说明"],"proposal_text":"本研究病例报告表用于记录受试者筛选、基线、随机分组、双盲辅助治疗及安全性随访各阶段的研究信息。依据本研究访视安排，病例报告表应采集筛选、基线及第1、2、4、6、8周访视和第10周安全性随访的数据，包括MADRS总分、SDS总分、C-SSRS自杀意念与行为评价、TEAE和SAE、生命体征、实验室检查、心电图以及合并用药等信息。病例报告表中的数据应与源数据保持一致，数据修改应留有稽查轨迹。","rationale":"依据已确认的研究访视策略、主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点及安全性终点，确定病例报告表应覆盖的访视与数据范围。医学作者需核实CRF具体模块、字段设计、数据录入方式和质疑管理流程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_e33a78fb6c13c651","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922165513_d22f8d4c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_ba8f1628e35c003b\n章节编号=10.2\n章节标题=数据源的定义","quote_sha256":"7348c644230b8e01b32785cbd3c454321198ac068c45b931436be8ce5a1a7536","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","span_id":"span_sec_10_2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"主要终点：第8周MADRS总分较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"7d24fedbdedcfe8cc33346a0687eeeaf0a92a196d921655654ce68ade2fb9d37","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"关键次要终点：第8周MADRS应答率（总分较基线下降≥50%）。；第8周MADRS缓解率（总分≤10）。","quote_sha256":"c6b07ab8e97508acf8ec3e6df0d7827dd61d340dc7bfa81ac3fd76b39029f057","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3: