据质量保证计划","监查计划","稽查计划"],"proposal_text":"数据质量保证应贯穿本研究数据采集、录入、核查、转移和分析的全过程。研究中心应按照研究方案和病例报告表的要求记录数据，确保数据的完整性、准确性和可溯源性。数据质量保证的范围包括病例报告表数据、源数据、安全性数据及统计报告相关数据。数据质量保证活动应依据适用法规和申办者质量体系要求开展，并保留相应记录，以保证研究数据符合方案要求并满足监管标准。","rationale":"依据已确认的研究设计和安全性数据范围，明确数据质量保证应覆盖的数据范畴与质量目标。共享语料中的质量保证抽查与稽查表述仅作为监管语境参考，具体质量保证活动、频率、角色和记录要求需结合本项目质量体系确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_e6d58b65cb2639c6","section_number":"10.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922165513_d22f8d4c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_af26510f73fdb1f1\n章节编号=10.4\n章节标题=资料保存与数据保护","quote_sha256":"57e82b1f55f959597eb13bf9d5e973aaf6a7c392d0fa06cc65bcf796f59b2966","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","span_id":"span_sec_10_4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"主要终点：第8周MADRS总分较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"7d24fedbdedcfe8cc33346a0687eeeaf0a92a196d921655654ce68ade2fb9d37","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"关键次要终点：第8周MADRS应答率（总分较基线下降≥50%）。；第8周MADRS缓解率（总分≤10）。","quote_sha256":"c6b07ab8e97508acf8ec3e6df0d7827dd61d340dc7bfa81ac3fd76b39029f057","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_key_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"其他次要终点：第8周SDS总分较基线变化。","quote_sha256":"5a098b4797e365e6b6c64280d863fe530402cee78289ce94f806735bff9bc5bc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE、SAE及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；C-SSRS自杀意念与行为评价及生命体征、实验室检查、心电图变化。","quote_sha256":"7fb7bdebd2adfade50a1cdec22f0c156522f0e83018fbf487ed008f708521362","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"span_safety"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_10_4","span_primary","span_key_secondary","span_other_secondary","span_safety"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充资料保存期限规定与数据保护计划，确认保存年限、销毁程序及数据保护技术措施。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_4_retention","missing_source_classes":["资料保存期限规定","数据保护计划","适用法规清单"],"target":"10.4 资料保存与数据保护"}],"heading":"资料保存与数据保护","missing_source_classes":["资料保存期限规定","数据保护计划","适用法规清单"],"proposal_text":"本研究的研究资料和数据应在研究期间及研究结束后按照适用法律法规和申办者要求保存。保存范围包括病例报告表、源数据、研究药物记录、安全性报告、伦理审查文件及监管文件。受试者个人健康信息，包括MADRS、SDS、C-SSRS、实验室检查、心电图及不良事件数据，应采取保密措施加以保护。数据保护措施应覆盖纸质和电子资料的访问、传输、存储和销毁环节，并保留相应记录。","rationale":"依据已确认的疗效与安全性评估数据范围，明确资料保存与数据保护应覆盖的记录类型和受试者信息类别。医学作者需核实适用法规、保存期限及数据保护计划中的具体措施。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_af26510f73fdb1f1","section_number":"10.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"432bfd41be067ef3db3b52e37682e6b371a48ed2f54120c9aad2b13f699d3840","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:fe1608b1ee6387a42ec8b42a","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protoc